{
  "version": 1,
  "i18n": {
    "zh-CN": {
      "noData": "取不到行情"
    },
    "en-US": {
      "noData": "Quote unavailable"
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kr",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${pair},btcusd)]"
      },
      "_note": "币对归一(v54 OKX):老实例存的是 Bitstamp 形状 `btcusd`,新实例是 OKX instId `BTC-USDT`,两种都认。⚠️ 先落地 kr 再算 —— 方法参数里看不见 flow 入参(§9.5 #3)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k",
        "value": "$[if::(contains::(${kr},-),toUpperCase::(${kr}),connect::(toUpperCase::(if::(endsWith::(${kr},usdt),subString::(${kr},0,calc::(length::(${kr})-4)),if::(endsWith::(${kr},usdc),subString::(${kr},0,calc::(length::(${kr})-4)),if::(endsWith::(${kr},usd),subString::(${kr},0,calc::(length::(${kr})-3)),${kr})))),-,if::(endsWith::(${kr},usdc),USDC,USDT)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "stpIn",
        "value": "${step}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "stp",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${stpIn},$),86400,findNotEmpty::(${stpIn},86400))]"
      },
      "_note": "K 线周期(秒)入参:详情页 90D 档传 259200(Bitstamp 原生 3 日线),小组件与 30D 档不传 → 双兜 86400(未传时 `${step}` 可能原样透传字面串)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bar",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${stp},3600),1H,if::(eq::(${stp},14400),4H,if::(eq::(${stp},604800),1Wutc,if::(eq::(${stp},259200),3Dutc,1Dutc))))]"
      },
      "_note": "Bitstamp step 秒数 → OKX bar。日线以上用 *utc 档:OKX 默认 `1D` 按 UTC+8 切日,卡上写的是 UTC 日界。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pk",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${stp},3600),0,if::(eq::(${stp},14400),1,if::(eq::(${stp},604800),3,2)))]"
      },
      "_note": "周期码(卡上文案按它切):0 = 1 小时 · 1 = 4 小时 · 2 = 日(默认,含详情页的 3 日档)· 3 = 周。组件参数 `step` 存秒数,由 /pick 的周期分段写回。"
    },
    {
      "action": "request",
      "id": "r",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://www.okx.com/api/v5/market/candles?instId=${k}&bar=${bar}&limit=20",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "json"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_bad",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${r.data}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      "_fb": 1,
      "_note": "OKX 没取到(被地区政策拦 / 超时 / 空)→ 走备用源 Coinbase(doc/overseas-first.md §10)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_s0",
        "value": "$[if::(endsWith::(${k},-SWAP),subString::(${k},0,calc::(length::(${k})-5)),${k})]"
      },
      "_fb": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_p",
        "value": "$[if::(endsWith::(${r_s0},-USDT),connect::(subString::(${r_s0},0,calc::(length::(${r_s0})-5)),-USD),if::(endsWith::(${r_s0},-USDC),connect::(subString::(${r_s0},0,calc::(length::(${r_s0})-5)),-USD),${r_s0}))]"
      },
      "_fb": 1,
      "_note": "备用源 Coinbase 的产品名(doc/overseas-first.md §10)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_g",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${bar}),k1H),3600,if::(eq::(connect::(k,${bar}),k1Dutc),86400,if::(eq::(connect::(k,${bar}),k1D),86400,0)))]"
      },
      "_fb": 1,
      "_note": "Coinbase 只有 1h / 1d 两档对得上;4H / 3D / 1W 没有备用(_g = 0)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_go",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${r_bad},1),if::(gt::(${r_g},0),1,0),0)]"
      },
      "_fb": 1
    },
    {
      "action": "concurrent",
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${r_go}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "request",
              "id": "r_c",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://api.exchange.coinbase.com/products/${r_p}/candles?granularity=${r_g}",
                "method": "GET",
                "formatType": "json",
                "timeout": "5000"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "_fb": 1,
      "_note": "备用请求(只在 OKX 没取到时发;每个都在 op:if 里)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bfb",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_fb": 1,
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求屏障(勿删):request / concurrent 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(memory actionflow-concurrent-late-merge)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_ok",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(${r_c},0),4),__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
      },
      "_fb": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_q",
        "value": "${r.data}"
      },
      "_fb": 1,
      "_note": "下游统一读 r_q:OKX 的 data,或下面按 OKX 形状重排的备用数据。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${r_ok}"
      },
      "_fb": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "r_q",
            "value": [
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},0),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},0),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},0),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},0),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},0),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},0),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},1),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},1),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},1),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},1),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},1),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},1),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},2),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},2),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},2),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},2),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},2),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},2),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},3),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},3),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},3),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},3),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},3),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},3),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},4),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},4),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},4),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},4),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},4),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},4),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},5),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},5),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},5),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},5),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},5),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},5),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},6),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},6),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},6),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},6),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},6),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},6),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},7),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},7),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},7),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},7),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},7),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},7),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},8),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},8),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},8),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},8),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},8),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},8),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},9),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},9),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},9),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},9),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},9),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},9),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},10),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},10),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},10),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},10),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},10),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},10),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},11),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},11),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},11),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},11),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},11),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},11),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},12),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},12),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},12),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},12),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},12),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},12),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},13),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},13),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},13),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},13),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},13),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},13),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},14),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},14),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},14),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},14),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},14),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},14),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},15),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},15),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},15),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},15),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},15),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},15),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},16),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},16),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},16),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},16),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},16),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},16),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},17),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},17),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},17),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},17),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},17),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},17),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},18),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},18),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},18),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},18),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},18),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},18),5),)]"
              ],
              [
                "$[connect::(parseNumber::(calc::(index::(index::(${r_c},19),0)*1000),0),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},19),3),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},19),2),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},19),1),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},19),4),)]",
                "$[connect::(index::(index::(${r_c},19),5),)]"
              ]
            ]
          },
          "_fb": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bfc",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_fb": 1,
      "_note": "⚠️ 屏障(勿删):op:if 复合节点之后紧邻的节点同样读不到它的结果 ——实测紧跟一个 remove 会让后面的节点全部取空(2026-10-01 CLI)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "r_c"
      },
      "_fb": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnt",
        "value": "$[length::(${r_q})]"
      },
      "_note": "逐日 20 根 ≈ 3KB。末根 = 今日(UTC 日界,进行中的那根)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lastO",
        "value": "$[index::(index::(${r_q},0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "px",
        "value": "$[index::(index::(${r_q},0),4)]"
      },
      "_note": "现价 = 今日这根的最新收盘。7×24 的市场没有「今天没数据」这一态,px 空只可能是取数失败 → 抛错(G26/§7.2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${px}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "${@i18n.noData}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lastH",
        "value": "$[index::(index::(${r_q},0),2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lastL",
        "value": "$[index::(index::(${r_q},0),3)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "oS",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${lastO},100),parseNumber::(${lastO},#\\,##0.00),parseNumber::(${lastO},0.0000))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hS",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${lastH},100),parseNumber::(${lastH},#\\,##0.00),parseNumber::(${lastH},0.0000))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lS",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${lastL},100),parseNumber::(${lastL},#\\,##0.00),parseNumber::(${lastL},0.0000))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "chg",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::((${px}-${lastO})/${lastO}*100),0.00)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "up",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${chg}),0),if::(ge::(${chg},0),1,0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "flat",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${chg}),0),if::(lt::(calc::(${chg}*${chg}),0.0004),1,0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "chgA",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${chg},0),${chg},calc::(0-${chg}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dTs",
        "value": "$[calc::(index::(index::(${r_q},0),0)+43200000)]"
      },
      "_note": "日 / 周档的末根 ts 是 UTC 零点;+12 小时再按本机时区格式化 = UTC 那一天(UTC−12…+11 都对),西半球不再标成前一天。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dMo",
        "value": "$[round::(parseNumber::(formatDate::(${dTs},MM),0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dDd",
        "value": "$[round::(parseNumber::(formatDate::(${dTs},dd),0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dMn",
        "value": "$[index::(split::(Jan~Feb~Mar~Apr~May~Jun~Jul~Aug~Sep~Oct~Nov~Dec,~),calc::(${dMo}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dZh",
        "value": "${dMo}月${dDd}日"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dEn",
        "value": "${dMn} ${dDd}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dt",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${stp},86400),formatDate::(index::(index::(${r_q},0),0),HH:mm),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${dZh},${dEn}))]"
      },
      "_note": "末根蜡烛的开盘时刻:小时档写本机 HH:mm;日 / 周档写 UTC 那一天,中文「10月1日」、英文「Oct 1」(overseas-first §5:不再出纯数字 10-01)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
